Revision history for Perl extension App-Greple-frame

1.04 2026-11-03T00:08:57Z

    - Require perl 5.26
    - Accept parameters by -Mframe::config(...) (Getopt::EX::Config).
      -Mframe::set(...) is kept only for compatibility and will be removed
      in the future.  An unknown parameter is an error now
    - Add module options --style and --width, placed before -- as
      -Mframe --style=fold --width=80 -- pattern file.  Everything before
      -- now belongs to the module, so -Mframe --frame pattern -- file is
      an error; write -Mframe --frame pattern file.  The command options
      such as --frame are kept for compatibility and may be removed in the
      future
    - The width parameter works with --frame-cols and --frame-pages.  The
      whole output has that width; it was ignored
    - Add module options --pane, --pane-width, --boundary, --linebreak,
      --runin, --runout and --runlen, which mean the same as in ansicolumn.
      Some could be given only by the environment variables
      GREPLE_FRAME_PAGES_WIDTH, _MARGIN and _BOUNDARY, which still give the
      default values.  --set-frame-column works now

1.03 2023-12-18T08:05:39Z

    - introduce --frame-cols option

